-- -->分钟阅读</span><span class="mx-2 inline-block"> · </span><span>Dec 9, 2025</span></div></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-8 border-t border-b p-2 border-surface-100"><div class="flex-1 flex items-center text-gray-500 text-sm space-x-6"><div class="inline-flex items-center text-surface-500 " aria-label="阅读"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-label="clap" class="w-6 h-6 mr-1 fill-current"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M11.37.83L12 3.28l.63-2.45h-1.26zM13.92 3.95l1.52-2.1-1.18-.4-.34 2.5zM8.59 1.84l1.52 2.11-.34-2.5-1.18.4zM18.52 18.92a4.23 4.23 0 0 1-2.62 1.33l.41-.37c2.39-2.4 2.86-4.95 1.4-7.63l-.91-1.6-.8-1.67c-.25-.56-.19-.98.21-1.29a.7.7 0 0 1 .55-.13c.28.05.54.23.72.5l2.37 4.16c.97 1.62 1.14 4.23-1.33 6.7zm-11-.44l-4.15-4.15a.83.83 0 0 1 1.17-1.17l2.16 2.16a.37.37 0 0 0 .51-.52l-2.15-2.16L3.6 11.2a.83.83 0 0 1 1.17-1.17l3.43 3.44a.36.36 0 0 0 .52 0 .36.36 0 0 0 0-.52L5.29 9.51l-.97-.97a.83.83 0 0 1 0-1.16.84.84 0 0 1 1.17 0l.97.97 3.44 3.43a.36.36 0 0 0 .51 0 .37.37 0 0 0 0-.52L6.98 7.83a.82.82 0 0 1-.18-.9.82.82 0 0 1 .76-.51c.22 0 .43.09.58.24l5.8 5.79a.37.37 0 0 0 .58-.42L13.4 9.67c-.26-.56-.2-.98.2-1.29a.7.7 0 0 1 .55-.13c.28.05.55.23.73.5l2.2 3.86c1.3 2.38.87 4.59-1.29 6.75a4.65 4.65 0 0 1-4.19 1.37 7.73 7.73 0 0 1-4.07-2.25zm3.23-12.5l2.12 2.11c-.41.5-.47 1.17-.13 1.9l.22.46-3.52-3.53a.81.81 0 0 1-.1-.36c0-.23.09-.43.24-.59a.85.85 0 0 1 1.17 0zm7.36 1.7a1.86 1.86 0 0 0-1.23-.84 1.44 1.44 0 0 0-1.12.27c-.3.24-.5.55-.58.89-.25-.25-.57-.4-.91-.47-.28-.04-.56 0-.82.1l-2.18-2.18a1.56 1.56 0 0 0-2.2 0c-.2.2-.33.44-.4.7a1.56 1.56 0 0 0-2.63.75 1.6 1.6 0 0 0-2.23-.04 1.56 1.56 0 0 0 0 2.2c-.24.1-.5.24-.72.45a1.56 1.56 0 0 0 0 2.2l.52.52a1.56 1.56 0 0 0-.75 2.61L7 19a8.46 8.46 0 0 0 4.48 2.45 5.18 5.18 0 0 0 3.36-.5 4.89 4.89 0 0 0 4.2-1.51c2.75-2.77 2.54-5.74 1.43-7.59L18.1 7.68z"></path></svg><span class="h-6 inline-block leading-6">47</span></div></div><div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-surface-500 hover:text-surface-800"><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-«R6dcfetlb»" data-state="closed" data-slot="popover-trigger" class="hover:bg-gray-100 rounded-md"><div class="h-9 w-9 flex items-center justify-center" aria-label="分享"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-share w-4 h-4 text-surface-500"><path d="M4 12v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-8"></path><polyline points="16 6 12 2 8 6"></polyline><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="2" y2="15"></line></svg></div></button><button data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><div class="h-9 flex items-center justify-center w-9 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-100 hover:text-surface-800" aria-label="举报"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-alert w-5 h-5"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="M12 8v4"></path><path d="M12 16h.01"></path></svg></div></button></div></div><div class="leading-8 text-[#242424] post-content md:mt-12 mt-8 text-lg space-y-7 text-wrap break-words overflow-hidden" style="word-break:break-word;overflow-wrap:break-word;hyphens:auto"><p><span style="text-indent: 2em;">智谱今日宣布正式开源其核心 AI Agent 模型 </span><strong style="text-indent: 2em;">AutoGLM</strong><span style="text-indent: 2em;">，这一具备“Phone Use”能力的智能体能够稳定完成外卖点单、机票预订等长达数十步的复杂手机操作流程。开源意味着任何硬件厂商、手机厂商及开发者，都可以在自己的系统中复现一个能“看懂屏幕”、并能像真人一样完成点击、输入、滑动等操作的 AI 助手。</span></p><p style="text-align: center"><img src="https://pic.chinaz.com/picmap/202011131621513213_3.jpg" title="玩手机，移动互联网 (图片来源图虫：已授站长之家使用)" alt="玩手机，移动互联网"/></p><p>AutoGLM 已支持包括微信、淘宝、抖音在内的超过50款高频中文应用的核心场景，其演示效果与此前引发行业关注的“豆包手机”极为相似:用户无需手动操作，只需让 AI 观察屏幕内容，它便可以自动执行任务、连续完成多步骤操作并直达结果。与其他智能体方案相比，AutoGLM 的优势在于稳定性与复杂流程处理能力，尤其适合在真实手机环境中执行长链条任务。</p><p>这一开源动作将显著降低 AI 手机的技术门槛，让“AI 能替你操作手机”不再是头部厂商的专属技术，而成为行业共同可构建的能力，推动 AI 手机生态从封闭走向开放，促使更多设备具备系统级智能体体验。AutoGLM 同时支持本地与云端部署，为厂商保留<span class="spamTxt">最大</span>化的数据与隐私控制权，也意味着用户未来有机会在无需上传隐私数据的前提下获得同等的智能体验。</p><p>对于正试图打造下一代系统级 AI 的手机厂商而言，AutoGLM 的开源无疑是一项战略级补全;对于开发者，它则提供了一个可复现、可修改、可扩展的完整智能体能力底座。随着更多厂商加入生态，这类具备真实交互能力的 AI Agent 可能会加速成为未来手机的标配能力。</p></div><div class="my-8 flex space-x-3 flex-wrap"><a class="tag-badge mb-4 cursor-pointer text-sm hover:bg-slate-200 bg-slate-100 text-slate-800 rounded inline-block py-1 px-2" href="/search/AI新词&amp;type=0">AI新词</a><a class="tag-badge mb-4 cursor-pointer text-sm hover:bg-slate-200 bg-slate-100 text-slate-800 rounded inline-block py-1 px-2" href="/search/AutoGLM&amp;type=0">AutoGLM</a><a class="tag-badge mb-4 cursor-pointer text-sm hover:bg-slate-200 bg-slate-100 text-slate-800 rounded inline-block py-1 px-2" href="/search/智能体&amp;type=0">智能体</a><a class="tag-badge mb-4 cursor-pointer text-sm hover:bg-slate-200 bg-slate-100 text-slate-800 rounded inline-block py-1 px-2" href="/search/品牌产品词&amp;type=0">品牌产品词</a></div></div><div class="px-4 flex flex-col mt-4 md:mt-8"><div class="flex flex-col rounded-lg border border-slate-200 w-full mx-auto"><div class="p-5 flex flex-col space-y-8"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><h4 class="text-xl font-semibold">本文来自AIbase日报</h4><button data-slot="hover-card-trigger" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive shadow-xs h-9 has-[&gt;svg]:px-3 bg-[#0080FF] text-white rounded-lg text-sm px-4 py-2 hover:bg-blue-500" data-state="closed">扫码查看</button></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-7">欢迎来到【AI日报】栏目!这里是你每天探索人工智能世界的指南，每天我们为你呈现AI领域的热点内容，聚焦开发者，助你洞悉技术趋势、了解创新AI产品应用。</p><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-end">—— <!-- -->由AIbase 日报组创作</div></div></div></div><div class="px-4"><div class="text-gray-600 text-xs mt-12">© 版权所有 AIbase基地 2024, 点击查看来源出处 - </div></div></div></article></div><!--$--><div class="bg-gray-100"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 md:py-20 py-8"><div class="max-w-[728px] tracking-wider mb-6 mx-auto flex flex-col flex-1"><div class="p-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-10 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900"><h3 class="text-xl">相关AI新闻推荐</h3></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-6"><a class="pb-8 overflow-hidden" target="_blank" href="/news/23516"><div class="relative h-40 rounded overflow-hidden bg-slate-100"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-transparent animate-pulse w-full h-full object-cover"><img alt="美国电网危机：AI 产业的未来悬于电力供给之上！" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="transition-opacity duration-300 object-cover opacity-0" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="https://pic.chinaz.com/picmap/thumb/202104261646199412_0.jpg"/></div></div><div class="pt-6"><div class="block group"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold line-clamp-2 mb-2 group-hover:underline">美国电网危机：AI 产业的未来悬于电力供给之上！</h2><p class="text-slate-600 line-clamp-2 text-sm">《金融时报》分析指出，美国电网因AI数据中心电力需求激增而面临巨大压力。预计到2028年，AI数据中心将新增约44吉瓦电力需求，但受限于电网基础设施瓶颈，仅能满足25吉瓦，导致约19吉瓦（占40%）的电力缺口，引发行业担忧。</p></div></div><div class="py-3 flex items-center justify-between"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-surface-500"><span>2025年12月9号 18:00</span><div class="inline-flex items-center text-surface-500" aria-label="views"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-label="clap"