opacity-0" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="https://pic.chinaz.com/picmap/202302150929449091_0.jpg"/></div></div><div class="pt-6"><div class="block group"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold line-clamp-2 mb-2 group-hover:underline">美国电网老化威胁 OpenAI 与微软扩张计划  ​</h2><p class="text-slate-600 line-clamp-2 text-sm">《金融时报》分析显示，美国电网因科技巨头数据中心投资激增而承压。预计到2028年，AI数据中心新增电力需求达44吉瓦，但电网瓶颈仅能供应约25吉瓦，导致近19吉瓦缺口，占总需求40%。亚马逊、谷歌等超大规模企业面临电力供应挑战。</p></div></div><div class="py-3 flex items-center justify-between"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-surface-500"><span>2025年12月9号 16:19</span><div class="inline-flex items-center text-surface-500" aria-label="views"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-label="clap" class="w-6 h-6 mr-1 fill-current"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M11.37.83L12 3.28l.63-2.45h-1.26zM13.92 3.95l1.52-2.1-1.18-.4-.34 2.5zM8.59 1.84l1.52 2.11-.34-2.5-1.18.4zM18.52 18.92a4.23 4.23 0 0 1-2.62 1.33l.41-.37c2.39-2.4 2.86-4.95 1.4-7.63l-.91-1.6-.8-1.67c-.25-.56-.19-.98.21-1.29a.7.7 0 0 1 .55-.13c.28.05.54.23.72.5l2.37 4.16c.97 1.62 1.14 4.23-1.33 6.7zm-11-.44l-4.15-4.15a.83.83 0 0 1 1.17-1.17l2.16 2.16a.37.37 0 0 0 .51-.52l-2.15-2.16L3.6 11.2a.83.83 0 0 1 1.17-1.17l3.43 3.44a.36.36 0 0 0 .52 0 .36.36 0 0 0 0-.52L5.29 9.51l-.97-.97a.83.83 0 0 1 0-1.16.84.84 0 0 1 1.17 0l.97.97 3.44 3.43a.36.36 0 0 0 .51 0 .37.37 0 0 0 0-.52L6.98 7.83a.82.82 0 0 1-.18-.9.82.82 0 0 1 .76-.51c.22 0 .43.09.58.24l5.8 5.79a.37.37 0 0 0 .58-.42L13.4 9.67c-.26-.56-.2-.98.2-1.29a.7.7 0 0 1 .55-.13c.28.05.55.23.73.5l2.2 3.86c1.3 2.38.87 4.59-1.29 6.75a4.65 4.65 0 0 1-4.19 1.37 7.73 7.73 0 0 1-4.07-2.25zm3.23-12.5l2.12 2.11c-.41.5-.47 1.17-.13 1.9l.22.46-3.52-3.53a.81.81 0 0 1-.1-.36c0-.23.09-.43.24-.59a.85.85 0 0 1 1.17 0zm7.36 1.7a1.86 1.86 0 0 0-1.23-.84 1.44 1.44 0 0 0-1.12.27c-.3.24-.5.55-.58.89-.25-.25-.57-.4-.91-.47-.28-.04-.56 0-.82.1l-2.18-2.18a1.56 1.56 0 0 0-2.2 0c-.2.2-.33.44-.4.7a1.5